      en: ["Liberated by the Red Army on January 27, 1945", "Over 1.1 million people were murdered in the camp complex", "Designated a UNESCO World Heritage site in 1979", "Birkenau covers 191 hectares with over 300 ruined buildings", "The State Museum was founded on July 2, 1947", "International Holocaust Remembrance Day is held on the liberation date"],
